 * app notifies (uuid / ulid / bigint / string) via the resolver inlined
 * below. The table is shared: the site's notifications land in it too, so
 * the resolver reads the models of the Martis guard, the default guard and
 * every `session` guard, and when their keys disagree (an `admins` guard
